<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2575] Add limit on minimal value of IGFS IPC port configuration</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2575</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Configure IPC configuration of IGFS with port equal 0.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Node start successfully.&lt;br/&gt;
Automatically configured port is not available to receive from configuration and IGFS stay unavailable for external process.&lt;br/&gt;
I suggest add check like this: 
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;assertParameter(port &amp;gt; 1023, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;port &amp;gt; 1023&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
